   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer, 32 GB or more). MiniMax-H3-Image needs ComfyUI 0.45 or newer. The workflow makes a 1024x1024 image in 2 steps with the pDMD-2steps LoRA (linoyts/MiniMax-H3-Image-pDMD-2steps) on the schedule it was distilled to: ManualSigmas at 1, 12/13 (written 0.9230769230769231) and 0, and gmlx PDD Heads with heads in order on, so step i reads PDD head i, as diffusers samples it. Put the LoRA's pytorch_lora_weights.safetensors in ComfyUI's models/loras folder as minimax-h3-image-pdmd-2steps.safetensors, or pick another name in the node. Read the model's license and the LoRA's card before you use the images: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/images.html#licenses\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull minimax-h3-image\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
